### 2026-10-01 | Thursday
Papers everywhere on my desk, and three mugs I keep meaning to wash. The tea went cold while I read the same page three times. The lamp was the only light by the end.

### 2026-10-02 | Friday
Rain at the bus stop. The 42 was late again, so I shared an umbrella with a stranger who smelled of oranges. We watched the puddles grow.

### 2026-10-03 | Saturday
Stayed in bed until noon with the cat asleep on my feet. Sun through the curtains. The book I'm reading is still face down on the pillow.
